  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Mainstreaming into National                Employment Program (NEP) - Gender Mainstreaming to National Employment</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsintegrering i den nationella syssels&#xe4;syssels&#xe4;ttningsprogram (NEP).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Sverige st&#xf6;djer Rwandas nationella syssels&#xe4;ttningsprogram (NEP) d&#xe4;r j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet &#xe4;r en viktig dialogfr&#xe5;ga. Samtidigt kommer st&#xf6;det till Adolescent Girls Initiative (AGI) att avslutas d&#xe5; aktiviteterna fr&#xe5;n AGI integreras in i NEP. Denna insats syftar till att finansiera en konsultstudie som ska samla l&#xe4;rdomar fr&#xe5;n AGI och facilitera integreringen av det framg&#xe5;ngsrika j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsarbetet in i NEP.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden is supporting the National Employment Program (NEP) and has specified gender mainstreaming as a significant objective for dialogue. Now that the succesful program of Adolescent Girls Initiative (AGI) is coming to an end, this contribution will fund a consultancy study that will aim at integrating the lessons learnt from AGI to NEP in order to promote gender issues countrywide.</narrative>
  </description>
